{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3bce722dd2724c30","name":"Bacta Tank","source":{"id":"source:reference-3bce722dd2724c30","title":"Bacta Tank","revision":21876,"timestamp":"2024-08-27T18:22:46Z","sha256":"c444671f019422d84530a65b81ae067ba87a981351becea8e91c71debabb26ba","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21876","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Bacta%20Tank&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3bce722dd2724c30","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ITEM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEIGHT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Bacta Tank (Empty)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["100,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["500 kg\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Bacta Tank (Full)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["130,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,100 kg\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Bacta (per liter)",{"tag":"sup","children":["1"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["100\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2 kg\n"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"sup","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["1: It takes 300 liters of Bacta to fill a Bacta Tank."]}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This large specialized tank is filled with the powerful healing agent, Bacta, which promotes rapid healing. A Bacta Tank can be used in conjunction with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery"},". If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check is successful, the patient heals a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to its Character Level, in addition to that provided by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery"},". A Bacta Tank can also be used when treating ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disease"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disease"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"}," in a creature. In this case, the Bacta Tank grants a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Bacta Tank and a supply of Bacta is expensive, so much medical equipment is usually found only in hospitals, aboard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},", and within major military bases. Each hour of treatment consumes one liter of Bacta, which costs 100 credits. A typical Bacta Tank holds up to 300 liters of Bacta, and the Bacta Tank must hold at least 150 liters at all times to provide any benefit. Only one creature can be immersed in the tank at any given time.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Breaking the transparisteel of a Bacta Tank (5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},") causes the bacta to spill onto the floor, forcing characters to make DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," checks to move without slipping and falling ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"},". When a tank spills its contents, any character in an adjacent square must succeed on this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," check immediately to avoid being knocked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," by the flow of bacta. Any character inside the tank at the time is dumped on the floor.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
